 dict(id='04-rainy',photo='7982837',title='Rain outside. A good stay inside.',headline='Rain outside.<br>A good stay inside.',sub='Tell them where the good stuff is.',kind='Feed',layout='rainy',alt='A family gathers around a table to play a game. The DigiStayBook post suggests making indoor activity details easy for guests to find.',caption='A rainy afternoon can still turn into a good vacation memory.\n\nIf your place has board games, books or a favorite rainy-day outing nearby, tell guests where to find them. A small note can make the things you’ve thoughtfully provided easier to enjoy.\n\nDigiStayBook brings your house guidance and personal tips into one guest page.\n\nSee an example welcome:',note='Stock family scene illustrates indoor time together. No weather event or actual DigiStayBook family is documented.'),
