boards=[]
for p in allposts:
 extra='<div class="shade"></div>' if p['kind']=='Story' else ''
 eye={'arrival':'Make yourself at home','breakfast':'The guest side of hosting','local':'From one local to your guests','rainy':'The little things you provide','memory':'Your property’s guest wall','story':'DigiStayBook / guest moments'}[p['layout']]
 sub='' if p['layout']=='rainy' else f'<p class="sub">{p["sub"]}</p>'
 insert='<span class="phone-label">Demo guest page</span><div class="phone"><img src="../reference/demo-arrival.png"></div>' if p['layout']=='breakfast' else ''
 if p['layout']=='rainy':insert=f'<p class="sub">{p["sub"]}</p>'
 if p['kind']=='Story':insert+='<p class="link-space">Explore the guest demo<br>at digistaybook.com</p>'
 boards.append(f'<article class="art {p["layout"]}" data-photo="{p["photo"]}" data-file="{p["file"]}"><img class="photo" src="../photos/{p["photo"]}.jpg">{extra}<div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">{eye}</p><h1>{p["headline"]}</h1>{sub}</div>{insert}<span class="disclosure">Stock photo · illustrative scene</span><footer class="brand"><img src="../reference/logo.png"><span>digistaybook.com</span></footer></article>')
(R/'source/boards.html').write_text('<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><style>'+css+'</style>'+''.join(boards),encoding='utf-8')
cards=[]
for p in allposts:
 credit=photos[p['photo']][0]
 cards.append(f'''<article id="{p['id']}" data-kind="{p['kind']}"><a class="image" href="assets/{p['file']}" target="_blank"><img src="assets/{p['file']}" alt="{e(p['alt'])}" loading="lazy"></a><div class="detail"><small>{p['kind']} · {'1080 × 1920' if p['kind']=='Story' else '1080 × 1350'}</small><h2>{e(p['title'])}</h2><p>{e(p['note'])}</p><div class="actions"><a href="assets/{p['file']}" download>Download PNG ↓</a><button class="copy">Copy {'posting note' if p['kind']=='Story' else 'caption'}</button></div><textarea class="caption" aria-label="Caption for {e(p['title'])}">{e(p['caption'])}</textarea><label>Your review <select class="status"><option>Draft · review needed</option><option>Keep</option><option>Changes needed</option><option>Skip</option></select></label><textarea class="note" rows="2" placeholder="Your changes…" aria-label="Review notes for {e(p['title'])}"></textarea><p class="credit">Photo: <a href="{p['source']}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{e(credit)} / Pexels</a></p></div></article>''')
reviewcss='''*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f7f2e8;color:#202624;font:16px/1.55 Arial,sans-serif}header,main{max-width:1240px;margin:auto;padding:40px 24px}header{padding-top:60px}h1{font:56px/1.05 Georgia;margin:14px 0 24px;max-width:820px}header img{width:250px}header p{max-width:780px}a{color:#943d26}nav,.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}nav{margin-top:25px}button,.actions a,nav a{font:inherit;border:1px solid #c5b7a2;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 15px;background:white;color:#74321f;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}button.active{background:#273c32;color:white}.count{display:block;color:#5d655f;font-size:14px;margin-top:16px}article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:32px;margin-bottom:56px;padding-bottom:48px;border-bottom:1px solid #d6ccbc}.image img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:7px}h2{font:32px/1.15 Georgia;margin:10px 0 15px}.detail{min-width:0}small{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:12px}textarea{width:100%;font:15px/1.5 Arial;padding:14px;border:1px solid #c7bdac;background:#fffdf8;border-radius:6px;margin:16px 0;resize:vertical}.caption{min-height:285px}.note{margin-top:7px}select{padding:9px;font:inherit;border:1px solid #c7bdac;border-radius:5px;width:100%;margin-top:6px}.credit{font-size:13px;color:#5d655f}.banner{padding:18px 22px;background:#e7ece5;border-radius:7px;max-width:860px}footer{padding:25px;background:#e8e0d1}.toast{position:fixed;bottom:20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:12px 24px;background:#273c32;color:white;border-radius:8px;display:none;z-index:2}@media(max-width:700px){header,main{padding:28px 18px}h1{font-size:40px}article{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}h2{font-size:29px}nav{gap:8px}button,.actions a,nav a{padding:9px 11px}.caption{min-height:305px}}'''
script='''const key='dsb-people-moments-20261029';let saved={};try{saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)||'{}')}catch{}const cards=[...document.querySelectorAll('article')];const toast=t=>{const el=document.querySelector('.toast');el.textContent=t;el.style.display='block';setTimeout(()=>el.style.display='none',2400)};for(const c of cards){const id=c.id,tx=c.querySelector('.caption'),st=c.querySelector('.status'),nt=c.querySelector('.note'),old=saved[id];if(old){tx.value=old.caption??tx.value;st.value=old.status??st.value;nt.value=old.note??''}const save=()=>{saved[id]={caption:tx.value,status:st.value,note:nt.value};localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(saved))};tx.oninput=nt.oninput=st.onchange=save;c.querySelector('.copy').onclick=async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(tx.value);toast('Copied')}catch{tx.focus();tx.select();toast('Select and copy the highlighted text')}}}document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===b));let n=0;cards.forEach(c=>{const show=b.dataset.filter==='All'||c.dataset.kind===b.dataset.filter;c.hidden=!show;c.style.display=show?'':'none';if(show)n++});document.querySelector('.count').textContent=n+' pieces shown'});document.querySelector('#export').onclick=()=>{const data=cards.map(c=>({id:c.id,caption:c.querySelector('.caption').value,status:c.querySelector('.status').value,note:c.querySelector('.note').value}));const u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify({collection:'people-moments-20261029',reviews:data},null,2)],{type:'application/json'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='DigiStayBook-people-review.json';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(u);toast('Review exported')};'''
(R/'REVIEW.html').write_text(f'''<!doctype html><html lang="en-AU"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>DigiStayBook · people & guest moments</title><style>{reviewcss}</style></head><body><header><a href="../../MARKETING_PLAN.html">← Marketing plan</a><p><img src="reference/logo.png" alt="DigiStayBook"></p><small>Additional creative drafts · 29 October 2026</small><h1>A stay with people in it.</h1><p>Five photo-led feed posts and three companion Stories. Real photographs, familiar vacation moments and short, useful copy.</p><p class="banner">Genuine stock photography illustrates these scenes. The people pictured are not presented as DigiStayBook customers. The product insert is a labeled fictional-demo capture. These are extra options for review; the existing calendar and publication records are unchanged.</p><nav><button data-filter="All" class="active">All 8</button><button data-filter="Feed">5 feed posts</button><button data-filter="Story">3 Stories</button><a href="DigiStayBook-people-content.zip" download>Download pack ↓</a><a href="../reels-people-2026-10-29/REVIEW.html">2 new Reels →</a><button id="export">Export my review</button><a href="CAPTIONS.md">All captions</a><a href="SOURCES.md">Photo credits</a></nav><span class="count">8 pieces shown · reviews save in this browser; export to share them.</span></header><main>{''.join(cards)}</main><footer>Prepared 29 October 2026. Drafts only. No posting, scheduling or account changes.</footer><div class="toast" role="status"></div><script>{script}</script></body></html>''',encoding='utf-8')
(R/'CAPTIONS.md').write_text('# DigiStayBook — people & guest moments\n\nFive feed posts and three companion Stories. Prepared 29 October 2026. Extra draft options, not an additional posting schedule.\n\n'+'\n\n'.join(f'## {p["id"]} — {p["title"]}\n\nFile: assets/{p["file"]}\n\n{p["caption"]}\n\nAlt text: {p["alt"]}\n\nProduction note: {p["note"]}' for p in allposts),encoding='utf-8')
(R/'SOURCES.md').write_text('''# Sources and production notes

Prepared 29 October 2026. Photos were downloaded and reviewed during this session. No AI imagery, image generation prompts or synthetic people were used. Layout and typography are ordinary HTML/CSS, exported with Playwright. Source photographs remain unchanged apart from cropping in the layouts; no product screen is inserted into a stock subject’s device.

Pexels source pages list these as free stock photos. Licence checked: https://www.pexels.com/license/ (read 28 October Sydney time, before midnight). Pexels permits use and modification; its restrictions include no implied endorsement. These are illustrative scenes, not customer stories, testimonials or proof of app usage. A short stock-photo disclosure is included in the artwork and feed captions.

'''+''.join(f'- `{pid}.jpg`: {author}, {title}. Source: {url}\n  Download: https://images.pexels.com/photos/{pid}/pexels-photo-{pid}.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=2200\n' for pid,(author,title,url) in photos.items())+'''
## Product grounding

- Current local `src/ui/pages/LandingPage.tsx`: property QR display, browser guest page, house guidance, local favorites, guest photos/messages and no guest account/app.
- `reference/demo-arrival.png`: existing 28 October capture from the current local app, `/stay/demo-cottage`. Fictional Seabreeze Cottage. Captured screen is labeled Demo in the artwork. This is source/demo appearance evidence, not a new release or a customer session.
- `reference/logo.png`: existing official transparent wordmark copied from `marketing/_reference/digistaybook-logo-long-transparent.png`.
- No price, performance metric, ratings promise or customer result is stated.

## Files and rebuild

- `source/build.py` creates editable source artwork, content JSON, review page and copy documents.
- `source/render.mjs` exports eight PNGs, a contact sheet and a validation manifest; it packages finished media/copy/credits, not unaltered stock photographs.
- Feed: 1080 × 1350. Stories: 1080 × 1920. Add a native Story link sticker before publishing.
- Review selections and edits live in a separate browser key, `dsb-people-moments-20261029`. Export the review to preserve or share it.
- Existing marketing calendar dates, approvals and external schedules are unchanged. This batch is a selection pool for owner review.
''',encoding='utf-8')
print('Built 5 feed posts, 3 Stories, captions, credits and review page.')
